#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:1 7724c6a67dbd4f4aad5499d488ae4250
msgid ""
"Detect forest, trees and shrub vegetation from 0.6-0.3 m satellite "
"imagery. Covers sparse forest, shrubland, small tree groups and narrow "
"tree lines, with height classes and tree crowns."
msgstr "从 0.6–0.3 米卫星影像中检测森林、树木和灌木植被。涵盖疏林、灌丛、小片树丛和狭窄树行，并支持高度分级和树冠提取。"

