#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:11 7c7fbe9acfa845df854e1f40bf0bab2c
msgid ""
"The model is trained on 0.6–0.3 m imagery from different regions and "
"climate zones. Its resolution is enough to find small groups of trees and"
" narrow tree lines. Use imagery from the growing season: leafless trees "
"and snow-covered vegetation are not the target class."
msgstr ""
"该模型基于不同地区和气候带的 0.6–0.3 "
"米影像训练，分辨率足以识别小片树丛和狭窄树行。请使用生长季影像：无叶树木和被雪覆盖的植被不属于目标类别。"

