#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:94 88db2e2e2b74425287e9c357d8f10bcc
msgid ""
"**Forest and trees v.2026-09-10** (Global, segmentation) was evaluated on"
" 8 areas of interest against manually annotated ground truth. Metrics are"
" area-based: IoU is the intersection-over-union of the predicted and "
"ground-truth vegetation masks, and F1, precision and recall are computed "
"on the overlapping mask area. The **v.2026-09-10** update refines tree-"
"crown extraction results."
msgstr ""
"**Forest and trees v.2026-09-10**（全球，分割）在 8 "
"个感兴趣区域中基于人工标注的真值进行了评估。指标按面积计算：IoU "
