#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:289 24a52941aa944053bd0b0eaf8118e761
msgid ""
"*Ground-truth crown counts from the updated report (2026-10-01). "
"v.2026-09-10 is substantially closer to the true count where the previous"
" model under-detected (La Banda, Madrid, Velilla de San Antonio), but it "
"over-segments dense canopy at Balanga and Cuenca — producing more crowns "
"than ground truth — so its mean relative count error (22.7%) is slightly "
"above v.2026-07-03 (19.4%). ⚠️ The false positives may also indicate the "
"lack of details in the manual labels as the mask-overlap accuracy (IoU / "
"F1) still favours v.2026-09-10 in those areas.*"
msgstr ""
"*真值树冠数量来自更新后的报告（2026-10-01）。在上一模型漏检的地点（La Banda、Madrid、Velilla de San "
"Antonio），v.2026-09-10 的结果明显更接近真实数量；但它在 Balanga 和 Cuenca "
"对茂密林冠过度分割——产生的树冠多于真值——因此其平均相对计数误差（22.7%）略高于 v.2026-07-03（19.4%）。⚠️ "
"这些误报也可能说明人工标注不够精细，因为在这些区域，掩膜重叠精度（IoU / F1）仍然是 v.2026-09-10 更优。*"

