#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:302 66629c16479b4ef488288d5025a354cd
msgid "Benchmarks - canopy height (CHM)"
msgstr "基准测试 - 冠层高度（CHM）"

#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:304 ade4ea58f9f9487a81929199064f1c46
msgid ""
"The **Height estimation** output (Canopy Height Model, CHM) is "
"benchmarked against lidar-derived ground truth on 5 m hexagons (max "
"aggregation). The current model **CHM v.2026-08-31** reduces the mean "
"absolute height error from **4.70 m to 3.24 m** (**−31%**) versus **CHM "
"v.2026-07-03** across 38 areas of interest, with the largest gains in "
"tall, structurally complex forest."
msgstr ""
"**高度估算** 输出（冠层高度模型，CHM）以激光雷达（lidar）导出的真值为参照，在 5 米六边形网格上（最大值聚合）进行基准测试。在 38"
" 个感兴趣区域中，当前模型 **CHM v.2026-08-31** 与 **CHM v.2026-07-03** 相比，将平均绝对高度误差从 "
"**4.70 米降至 3.24 米**（**−31%**），在高大且结构复杂的森林中提升最为显著。"

#: ../userguides/forest_model.rst:311 190808dcd5294e0f9738e9a53783cf26
msgid ""
"📊 See :doc:`canopy-height (CHM) benchmark details (v.2026-08-31) "
"<forest_chm_benchmark_2026-08-31>` for the most-improved sample per "
"country, with lidar ground truth and prediction-vs-lidar error maps."
msgstr ""
"📊 请参阅 :doc:`冠层高度（CHM）基准测试详情（v.2026-08-31） "
"<forest_chm_benchmark_2026-08-31>`，了解每个国家改进最大的样本，以及激光雷达真值和预测与激光雷达对比的误差图。"

